# AtomicChat's LFM3-1.7B-Uncensored AD-Q6_K, re-encoded as Q8_0 (llama-quantize --allow-requantize ... Q8_0):
# Q6_K matmuls run 80 t/s prefill on Neoverse-N1 against 126 t/s for Q8_0, and the re-encode drifts no more
# from the Q6_K logits (KLD 0.004) than building the same Q6_K file with another compiler does.
LLM_MODEL=/opt/llm/models/LFM3-1.7B-Uncensored-Q6K-as-Q8_0.gguf
LLM_ALIASES=LFM3-1.7B
LLM_PORT=8083
# Full sliding-window cache so cached prefixes stay reusable; greedy, as LiquidAI advises.
LLM_ARGS=--swa-full --temp 0
